# Would you like to try this?!

<iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/tVgQLwNkS9s" width="560" height="315" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen"></iframe>Rhythm Culture Dundun dancers meet every Thursday 6.30pm for one hour of drumming , dancing and stomping fun. Get your shoes off and beat the drum with women on the Sunshine Coast!! $20 casual $70 x 4 weeks @ Palmwoods Memorial Hall
